# 背景色変更 with 仮身属性と同じ (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py on a kernel built
# with UITEST=1: TADjsについて (基本文章編集, a process) asks with DT_RQ_PAPER from its
# menu (表示, 背景色変更 at 752,645), and the pop-up opens at the pointer, held to the
# foot of the screen (its chart from 760,682, 15 apart, and the switch 仮身属性と同じ
# at 770,781 under it). The object's metadata gives it a paper: the switch starts
# off. A colour of the chart chosen is kept as its paper; the switch put on takes
# the paper away (the answer TAD_COL_NONE) and the document lays itself on the
# link's 表示領域背景 or the system's look; opened again, the switch is on. The
# work area is looked at, not only the console: red, then the 表示領域背景 of the link in
# BTRON it was opened from (ffffff), also after Escape.
#
# 1. red (the chart's fourth row, first column) chosen and kept with Enter
logmark
click 600 560 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 600
move 610 506
wait 200
move 610 525
wait 400
move 680 525
wait 600
move 752 645
wait 400
click 752 645
expectsince desktop: paper asked, same off
wait 1000
shot paper_open
click 770 727
wait 400
key 28
expectsince desktop: paper own ff0000 (0)
expectsince document: paper #ff0000
wait 1000
shot paper_red
pixel 700 215 FF0000
#
# 2. opened again: off, the paper being the object's own; put on and kept
logmark
click 600 560 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 600
move 610 506
wait 200
move 610 525
wait 400
move 680 525
wait 600
move 752 645
wait 400
click 752 645
expectsince desktop: paper asked, same off
wait 1000
click 770 781
wait 400
shot paper_same_on
key 28
expectsince desktop: paper same ffffff (0)
expectsince document: paper same as the link: #ffffff
wait 1000
shot paper_same
pixel 700 215 FFFFFF
#
# 3. opened again: on, the metadata giving no paper now. A colour chosen puts the
# switch off; Escape leaves the object as it was
logmark
click 600 560 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 600
move 610 506
wait 200
move 610 525
wait 400
move 680 525
wait 600
move 752 645
wait 400
click 752 645
expectsince desktop: paper asked, same on
wait 1000
shot paper_again
click 770 727
wait 400
shot paper_again_red
key 29
wait 1000
pixel 700 215 FFFFFF
